    "status": "present",
    "value": "Model time as the range [0, 10^9). A booking adds 1 to every moment in [start, end), and the answer is the global maximum. A segment tree supports range add and range maximum in O(log C), but a full tree over 10^9 points is impossible, so nodes are created only when an update descends into them. Each node stores added (how much was added to its whole range) and best (the maximum inside its range, including added). Fully covered nodes take +1 in both; partially covered nodes recurse and recompute best = added + max(best of children). The root's best is the answer."
  },
