        "value": "Use parallel arrays left, right, added and best, with node 0 as a permanent empty child and node 1 as the root over [0, 10^9). update(node, low, high, start, end): if [low, high) lies inside [start, end), increment added and best. Otherwise split at middle, create a child if needed for each side the interval reaches, recurse, and recompute best. book returns best[1]."
      },
